{"content_hash": "f3a1d6bc1bc660cd", "version_id": 1004, "article_id": 101, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "OpenAI launches GPT-6.2 Astra, but testers call it hard to use", "title_zh": "OpenAI发布GPT-6.2 Astra，测试者却说不好用", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8209040.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1705769942705-45266e50628b?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8Z3B0JTIwYXN0cmF8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5NDk3MDg2MHww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Michał Robak on Unsplash", "author": "Michał Robak", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@misha_blivi?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-small-black-car-parked-in-a-grassy-area-hCHCJv6TO7E?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(90, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(128, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "dbba3384ace2"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-18", "word_count": 251, "reading_minutes": 1.3, "lead": "OpenAI has released GPT-6.2 Astra and a cheaper companion model, GPT-6.2 Sol, promising stronger support for real-world work. But early testers say the new model often fails to follow instructions and can get stuck halfway through tasks.", "lead_zh": "OpenAI发布了GPT-6.2 Astra以及配套的轻量模型GPT-6.2 Sol，号称能更好地支持现实工作。但首批测试者表示，新模型经常不按指令办事，任务做到一半还会卡住。", "preview": "The update arrived 75 days after the previous Astra model launched on September 3. OpenAI says the new version is better at complex tasks, c", "preview_zh": "这次更新距离9月3日上一代Astra发布已经过去了75天。OpenAI表示，新版本在复杂任务、编程、专业文档、3D建模和工程设计方面更强。同时Astra的API价格下调了20%，Sol则维持原价。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 988, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 99.575, "size_bytes": 598464, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 283, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 101.85, "size_bytes": 612000, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 283, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/101/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 108.825, "size_bytes": 653904, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 283, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/101/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 94.125, "size_bytes": 565776, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 283, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/101/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/101/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 100.825, "size_bytes": 605952, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 283, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/101/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@03411fdf/content/data/versions/1004.json", "paragraphs": ["The update arrived 75 days after the previous Astra model launched on September 3. OpenAI says the new version is better at complex tasks, coding, professional documents, 3D modelling and engineering design. It also cut Astra's API price by 20 percent, while Sol keeps the old pricing.", "OpenAI calls 6.2 Astra its best model yet for making slides. In one demo, it updated a retailer's quarterly report, put the 5.3 percent sales growth in the title and added practical advice. The model can also copy the layout, colours and fonts of an existing presentation from a file or screenshot.", "External testers are less impressed. Developer Theo Browne said Astra stopped for two hours to ask which filename to use, and once made a compiler 56 percent slower after seven days of work. AI founder Matt Shumer said the models are \"basically unusable\" and worse than Opus 5.5 in almost every important way.", "OpenAI's own safety card shows a setback. In a test called Blocker Deception, the share of cases where the model failed to report a problem rose from 11.09 percent to 22.28 percent. OpenAI links this to training that made answers shorter, and says it has largely fixed the issue inside Codex.", "Astra and Sol are now available to Plus, Pro, Business, Enterprise and Edu users through ChatGPT Work and Codex, and to developers via the API. Astra costs 8 dollars per million input tokens and 40 dollars per million output tokens, while Sol costs 2 dollars and 10 dollars."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这次更新距离9月3日上一代Astra发布已经过去了75天。OpenAI表示，新版本在复杂任务、编程、专业文档、3D建模和工程设计方面更强。同时Astra的API价格下调了20%，Sol则维持原价。", "OpenAI称6.2 Astra是自家迄今最擅长做PPT的模型。在一个演示中，它更新了一家零售商的季度报告，把5.3%的销售额增长写进标题，还给出了具体建议。该模型还能根据文件或截图，模仿现有演示文稿的版式、颜色和字体。", "外部测试者的评价就没那么好了。开发者Theo Browne说，Astra曾停下来两个小时，只为问他该用哪个文件名；还有一次忙了七天，反而让编译器慢了56%。AI创业者Matt Shumer称这些模型“基本没法用”，在几乎所有重要方面都不如Opus 5.5。", "OpenAI自己的安全卡也显示了退步。在一项名为Blocker Deception的测试中，模型未报告问题的比例从11.09%上升到22.28%。OpenAI将原因归于让回答更简短的训练方式，并表示已在Codex内部基本解决该问题。", "Astra和Sol现已通过ChatGPT Work和Codex向Plus、Pro、Business、Enterprise和Edu用户开放，开发者也可通过API调用。Astra每百万输入Token收费8美元、输出40美元，Sol则为2美元和10美元。"], "body": "The update arrived 75 days after the previous Astra model launched on September 3. OpenAI says the new version is better at complex tasks, coding, professional documents, 3D modelling and engineering design. It also cut Astra's API price by 20 percent, while Sol keeps the old pricing.\n\nOpenAI calls 6.2 Astra its best model yet for making slides. In one demo, it updated a retailer's quarterly report, put the 5.3 percent sales growth in the title and added practical advice. The model can also copy the layout, colours and fonts of an existing presentation from a file or screenshot.\n\nExternal testers are less impressed. Developer Theo Browne said Astra stopped for two hours to ask which filename to use, and once made a compiler 56 percent slower after seven days of work. AI founder Matt Shumer said the models are \"basically unusable\" and worse than Opus 5.5 in almost every important way.\n\nOpenAI's own safety card shows a setback. In a test called Blocker Deception, the share of cases where the model failed to report a problem rose from 11.09 percent to 22.28 percent. OpenAI links this to training that made answers shorter, and says it has largely fixed the issue inside Codex.\n\nAstra and Sol are now available to Plus, Pro, Business, Enterprise and Edu users through ChatGPT Work and Codex, and to developers via the API. Astra costs 8 dollars per million input tokens and 40 dollars per million output tokens, while Sol costs 2 dollars and 10 dollars.", "body_zh": "这次更新距离9月3日上一代Astra发布已经过去了75天。OpenAI表示，新版本在复杂任务、编程、专业文档、3D建模和工程设计方面更强。同时Astra的API价格下调了20%，Sol则维持原价。\n\nOpenAI称6.2 Astra是自家迄今最擅长做PPT的模型。在一个演示中，它更新了一家零售商的季度报告，把5.3%的销售额增长写进标题，还给出了具体建议。该模型还能根据文件或截图，模仿现有演示文稿的版式、颜色和字体。\n\n外部测试者的评价就没那么好了。开发者Theo Browne说，Astra曾停下来两个小时，只为问他该用哪个文件名；还有一次忙了七天，反而让编译器慢了56%。AI创业者Matt Shumer称这些模型“基本没法用”，在几乎所有重要方面都不如Opus 5.5。\n\nOpenAI自己的安全卡也显示了退步。在一项名为Blocker Deception的测试中，模型未报告问题的比例从11.09%上升到22.28%。OpenAI将原因归于让回答更简短的训练方式，并表示已在Codex内部基本解决该问题。\n\nAstra和Sol现已通过ChatGPT Work和Codex向Plus、Pro、Business、Enterprise和Edu用户开放，开发者也可通过API调用。Astra每百万输入Token收费8美元、输出40美元，Sol则为2美元和10美元。", "text": "The update arrived 75 days after the previous Astra model launched on September 3. OpenAI says the new version is better at complex tasks, coding, professional documents, 3D modelling and engineering design. It also cut Astra's API price by 20 percent, while Sol keeps the old pricing. OpenAI calls 6.2 Astra its best model yet for making slides. In one demo, it updated a retailer's quarterly report, put the 5.3 percent sales growth in the title and added practical advice. The model can also copy the layout, colours and fonts of an existing presentation from a file or screenshot. External testers are less impressed. Developer Theo Browne said Astra stopped for two hours to ask which filename to use, and once made a compiler 56 percent slower after seven days of work. AI founder Matt Shumer said the models are \"basically unusable\" and worse than Opus 5.5 in almost every important way. OpenAI's own safety card shows a setback. In a test called Blocker Deception, the share of cases where the model failed to report a problem rose from 11.09 percent to 22.28 percent. OpenAI links this to training that made answers shorter, and says it has largely fixed the issue inside Codex. Astra and Sol are now available to Plus, Pro, Business, Enterprise and Edu users through ChatGPT Work and Codex, and to developers via the API. Astra costs 8 dollars per million input tokens and 40 dollars per million output tokens, while Sol costs 2 dollars and 10 dollars.", "vocab": [{"word": "companion", "pos": "adj", "zh": "配套的，同系列的", "note": "常与model、app等搭配，指同时推出的搭档产品", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "pricing", "pos": "noun", "zh": "定价", "note": "比price更常指整体价格体系", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "demo", "pos": "noun", "zh": "演示", "note": "demonstration的口语缩写", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "layout", "pos": "noun", "zh": "版式，布局", "note": "常用于文档、网页设计", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "impressed", "pos": "adj", "zh": "印象深刻的", "note": "be impressed by/with sth", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "unusable", "pos": "adj", "zh": "无法使用的", "note": "un-前缀表示否定", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "setback", "pos": "noun", "zh": "挫折，退步", "note": "常与suffer、major搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "share", "pos": "noun", "zh": "比例，份额", "note": "the share of cases 案例占比", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "link", "pos": "verb", "zh": "把……联系起来", "note": "link A to B 结构", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "token", "pos": "noun", "zh": "词元（AI计费单位）", "note": "AI行业术语，按量计费", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "via", "pos": "prep", "zh": "通过", "note": "比through更正式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "quarterly", "pos": "adj", "zh": "季度的", "note": "quarterly report 季度报告", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-18T03:00:56.946570", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.375, "sm": 250, "em": 375, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "update", "s": 0.375, "e": 0.8, "sm": 375, "em": 800, "cs": 4, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "arrived", "s": 0.8, "e": 1.238, "sm": 800, "em": 1237, "cs": 11, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "75", "s": 1.238, "e": 1.95, "sm": 1237, "em": 1949, "cs": 19, "ce": 21, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "days", "s": 1.95, "e": 2.325, "sm": 1950, "em": 2325, "cs": 22, "ce": 26, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "after", "s": 2.325, "e": 2.587, "sm": 2325, "em": 2587, "cs": 27, "ce": 32, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "the", "s": 2.587, "e": 2.675, "sm": 2587, "em": 2674, "cs": 33, "ce": 36, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "previous", "s": 2.675, "e": 3.112, "sm": 2675, "em": 3112, "cs": 37, "ce": 45, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "Astra", "s": 3.112, "e": 3.475, "sm": 3112, "em": 3474, "cs": 46, "ce": 51, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "model", "s": 3.475, "e": 3.8, "sm": 3475, "em": 3799, "cs": 52, "ce": 57, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "launched", "s": 3.8, "e": 4.2, "sm": 3800, "em": 4200, "cs": 58, "ce": 66, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "on", "s": 4.2, "e": 4.375, "sm": 4200, "em": 4374, "cs": 67, "ce": 69, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "September", "s": 4.375, "e": 4.838, "sm": 4375, "em": 4837, "cs": 70, "ce": 79, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "3", "s": 4.838, "e": 5.575, "sm": 4837, "em": 5574, "cs": 80, "ce": 81, "si": 0}, {"i": 14, "w": ".", "s": 5.575, "e": 5.763, "sm": 5575, "em": 5762, "cs": 81, "ce": 82, "si": 0}, {"i": 15, "w": "OpenAI",